  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PSD: Kinoni Produce Farm Limited &amp; Sdr.Esp/Jens Jensen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kinoni Produce Farm Limited, Uganda and Sdr.Esp, Denmark have agreed to apply for the DANIDA Private Sector Development Programme support for a long-term cooperation after a successful Start Up project. The Start Up Phase lasted for a year and ended in 2005 with almost all the objectives achieved. 
 
The project partnership will enter into a long-term technical cooperation to use the SUP results and recommended technology to develop Kinoni farm into a commercially strong and viable position by establishing, developing, and utilising the synergy between the three commercial &#x201c;legs&#x201d; at Kinoni, which is Piggery, Maize growing, and Maize supply including World Food Programme contracts.</narrative>
  </description>
